msgctxt "0x50/0"
msgid "Hail"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "0x50/1"
msgid ""
"It's time to build your city!  Remember that Temples guard the precious "
"Denarii in your treasury.  You should build some to keep it safe -- the "
"more temples you have, the less Denarii taken when one is robbed."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:420
msgctxt "0x51/0"
msgid "Disease!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:420
msgctxt "0x51/1"
msgid ""
"Due to poor sanitation and lack of hospital coverage, an epidemic has "
"broken out in the city.  Isolate the area to prevent contagion, but "
"remember -- an ounce of prevention equals a pound of cure!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:410
msgctxt "0x52/0"
msgid "Fire Alert!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:410
msgctxt "0x52/1"
msgid ""
"A fire has broken out somewhere in the city! It will quickly spread to "
"adjacent buildings, unless contained or put out by vigiles."
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:486 src/bbarian.c:536
msgctxt "0x53/0"
msgid "The City Is Attacked!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:486 src/bbarian.c:536
msgctxt "0x53/1"
msgid ""
"Enemies have reached the city -- it is sure to be sacked!  City walls "
"will only keep them at bay for a limited time -- soldiers will have to "
"meet the threat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "0x54/0"
msgid "Another Year Passes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "0x54/1"
msgid "And you haven't been stabbed to death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "0x55/0"
msgid "Services Cut"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "0x55/1"
msgid ""
"Due to a lack of Denarii spent on pleb welfare, the number of pleb "
"groups has fallen back such that for the first time, services to the "
"city have had to be lessened. This warning will only be given ONCE."
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:1021 src/formulae.c:1114
msgctxt "0x56/0"
msgid "Stolen!"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:1021 src/formulae.c:1114
msgctxt "0x56/1"
msgid ""
"Robbers have broken into one of your temples and stolen some of the "
"treasury. You need better security, or you do not have enough temples "
"to store your gold."
msgstr ""

#: src/evolver.c:1460
msgctxt "0x57/0"
msgid "Rioting!"
msgstr ""

#: src/evolver.c:1460
msgctxt "0x57/1"
msgid ""
"Mobs are forming in parts of the city.  Regardless of the cause -- high "
"taxes?  Conscription?  Unrest? -- their threat is clear."
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:987 src/formulae.c:1002 src/formulae.c:1077 src/formulae.c:1093
msgctxt "0x58/0"
msgid "Attempted Robbery"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:987 src/formulae.c:1002 src/formulae.c:1077 src/formulae.c:1093
msgctxt "0x58/1"
msgid ""
"An attempt was made to steal your unprotected Denarii; fortunately, it "
"failed.  In the future, you may not be so lucky -- so build some "
"temples to hold the treasury and ensure adequate patrols in their "
"vicinity!"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:989 src/formulae.c:1004 src/formulae.c:1079 src/formulae.c:1095
msgctxt "0x59/0"
msgid "Stolen!"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:989 src/formulae.c:1004 src/formulae.c:1079 src/formulae.c:1095
msgctxt "0x59/1"
msgid ""
"Thieves have run off with much of your treasury.  Leaving your Denarii "
"lying around on the floor of the Forum has proven to be a bad idea.  "
"Have you considered building some temples to store it?"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:1799
msgctxt "0x5a/0"
msgid "Too many Cohorts!"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:1799
msgctxt "0x5a/1"
msgid ""
"Your Legion can only be split into ten cohorts.  You cannot raise "
"another one."
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:303
msgctxt "0x5b/0"
msgid "Raiders Sighted!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:303
msgctxt "0x5b/1"
msgid ""
"A Barbarian raiding party has been sighted entering the province.  Your "
"outlying towns and villages will be at risk unless some action is taken."
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:381
msgctxt "0x5c/0"
msgid "Local Uprising!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:381
msgctxt "0x5c/1"
msgid ""
"A village or town in your province has rejected Rome's right of "
"sovereignty.  The local officials have been killed and scouts report a "
"makeshift army is heading for the city!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:333
msgctxt "0x5d/0"
msgid "Barbarian Invasion!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:333
msgctxt "0x5d/1"
msgid ""
"A large barbarian horde is traveling towards your province, crushing "
"all before them.  They will surely head for the city!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:363
msgctxt "0x5e/0"
msgid "Enemy Invades!"
msgstr ""

#: src/bbarian.c:363
msgctxt "0x5e/1"
msgid ""
"Worried at Rome's increasing influence in the area, your rivals have "
"launched an all-out attack.  Scouts report they are marching towards "
"your city at this very moment!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2259
msgctxt "0x5f/0"
msgid "Walls Attacked!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2259
msgctxt "0x5f/1"
msgid ""
"One of your provincial walls is under attack!  The defenders will try "
"to hold out for as long as possible, but without the assistance of a "
"Cohort they are hopelessly outnumbered!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:981
msgctxt "0x60/0"
msgid "Defenses Breached!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:981
msgctxt "0x60/1"
msgid "A portion of your provincial wall has been stormed by its besiegers!"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:3587
msgctxt "0x61/0"
msgid "Illegal Order"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:3587
msgctxt "0x61/1"
msgid ""
"You cannot issue orders to a demobilized cohort, or to one that is "
"reported unfit for battle."
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:42
msgctxt "0x62/0"
msgid "No Denarii!"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:42
msgctxt "0x62/1"
msgid ""
"You have exhausted the funds in your treasury.  The Emperor will cover "
"your accounts for some time, but you must return to a surplus of funds "
"soon."
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:48
msgctxt "0x63/0"
msgid "Stern Warning"
msgstr ""

#: src/formulae.c:48
msgctxt "0x63/1"
msgid ""
"The Emperor strongly suggests that you return to profitability.  There "
"are many Romans who would be willing to take over for a failing Governor!"
msgstr ""

#: src/empire.c:93
msgctxt "0x64/0"
msgid "The Empire Expands!"
msgstr ""

#: src/empire.c:93
msgctxt "0x64/1"
msgid ""
"Another province has been conquered by the mighty legion commanded by "
"the renowned Pompous Maximus.  The Senate in Rome has decreed a parade "
"of Triumph."
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:1223 src/action.c:1601
msgctxt "0x65/0"
msgid "Insufficient Plebs"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:1223 src/action.c:1601
msgctxt "0x65/1"
msgid ""
"The Plebeian Tribune reports that you do not have enough able-bodied "
"plebs available to support construction activities."
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:802 src/action.c:806
msgctxt "0x66/0"
msgid "Too Many Flags!"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:802 src/action.c:806
msgctxt "0x66/1"
msgid ""
"You have already placed the maximum available number of flags on this "
"map. To place a new flag, you must remove an old one first."
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:4265 src/action.c:4291 src/action.c:4318
msgctxt "0x67/0"
msgid "No Flags"
msgstr ""

#: src/action.c:4265 src/action.c:4291 src/action.c:4318
msgctxt "0x67/1"
msgid "You do not have any flags of this type to view."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:223
msgctxt "0x68/0"
msgid "Good Going!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:223
msgctxt "0x68/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 200 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:224
msgctxt "0x69/0"
msgid "Well Done!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:224
msgctxt "0x69/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 500 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:225
msgctxt "0x6a/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:225
msgctxt "0x6a/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 1,000 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:226
msgctxt "0x6b/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:226
msgctxt "0x6b/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 2,000 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:227
msgctxt "0x6c/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:227
msgctxt "0x6c/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 5,000 for the first time in its history!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:228
msgctxt "0x6d/0"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:228
msgctxt "0x6d/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 10,000 for the first time in its history!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:229
msgctxt "0x6e/0"
msgid "Incredible!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:229
msgctxt "0x6e/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 20,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:230
msgctxt "0x6f/0"
msgid "Unbelievable!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:230
msgctxt "0x6f/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 30,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:231
msgctxt "0x70/0"
msgid "Astounding!"
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:231
msgctxt "0x70/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 40,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2588
msgctxt "0x71/0"
msgid "Town captured!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2588
msgctxt "0x71/1"
msgid "Barbarians have looted and settled in one of your outlying towns!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2600
msgctxt "0x72/0"
msgid "Destruction!"
msgstr ""

#: src/int_c2.c:2600
msgctxt "0x72/1"
msgid ""
"Barbarians are rampaging unchecked through the province -- your people "
"are frightened."
msgstr ""

#: src/census.c:233 src/census.c:234 src/census.c:235 src/census.c:236 src/census.c:237 src/census.c:238
msgctxt "0x73/0"
msgid "New Structure Available"
msgstr ""

