#. help page 115: title
msgctxt "help/115/0"
msgid "Help with Rivers"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/115/1"
msgid ""
"Rivers provide water to your city by means of reservoirs, which feed "
"aqueducts and fountains. Rivers can also provide protection, as enemy "
"troops will not be able to cross them without bridges. When you begin "
"to design your city, consider the river both as a source of water and "
"as a protective barrier."
msgstr ""

