#. help page 118: title
msgctxt "help/118/0"
msgid "Housing (cont.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/118/1"
msgid ""
"There are twenty levels of housing, ranging from Hut to Palace. The "
"higher-quality housing attracts more people, who earn higher income and "
"pay more taxes, so it is wise to encourage housing to develop. The "
"development of housing depends on Land Values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#145Previous Page#\n"
