msgctxt "help/416/1"
msgid ""
"If you sense that barbarians are always approaching your city from the "
"same directions, try building groups of towers along the walls that "
"they first hit.  Also make sure to build gates near the towers to give "
"your soldiers better access to the enemy. \n"
