msgctxt "help/431/1"
msgid ""
"If you have built a wall around your city, you can better defend it by "
"building a road just inside the wall, and placing barracks next to that "
"road at regular intervals.  Make sure you build gates on the road as "
"well, so that your soldiers can reach enemies before they enter the "
"city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
