#. help page 520: title
msgctxt "help/520/0"
msgid "Help with Arenas"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/520/1"
msgid ""
"The Arena is a place where spectators come to watch staged fights "
"between captured enemies, wild animals, slaves, and so on. If a regular "
"arena ceases to adequately thrill your populace, you will eventually be "
"able to build the more advanced Colosseum, which will be accessible to "
"a wider area. Like the other Entertainment buildings, Arenas will raise "
"surrounding land values and will improve your city's Culture rating.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#521Tips# / #522History#"
msgstr ""

