#. help page 730: title
msgctxt "help/730/0"
msgid "Help with Rocky Areas"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/730/1"
msgid ""
"Rocky areas are places in your Province where you may place quarries "
"and/or mines. To place a quarry or mine, just select the quarry or mine "
"option in the Industry button, and place the structure down on a Rocky "
"Area. You may also build Forts, Trading Posts, and other buildings on "
"Rocky Areas, but you may want to set them aside for quarries and mines."
