#. help page 745: title
msgctxt "help/745/0"
msgid "Help with Meadows"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/745/1"
msgid ""
"Meadows are areas in your Province that are fit for farming. To place a "
"farm, select Industry on the Control Panel, select Farm, and click on a "
"Meadow area. Different provinces will have different agricultural "
"possibilities. You may be able to choose from among several available "
"crops, which will then be sent into your city to be processed by "
"Businesses and sold by Markets."
msgstr ""

#. help page 746: title
msgctxt "help/746/0"
msgid "Industries and Industrial Support"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/746/1"
msgid ""
"When selecting a site for an industry, make sure that it has plenty of "
"empty space next to it so that you can give it road access, a work camp "
"and one or more warehouses.  Some sites will have more accessibility "
"than others.\n"
"\n"
"Don't build more workcamps than you can easily fill with plebs; if you "
"do, all of your industries will suffer for it.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
