#. help page 760: title
msgctxt "help/760/0"
msgid "Help with the Capital City"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/760/1"
msgid ""
"Your Capital City is the focal point of your Province, and serves as "
"the arena for all game play on the City Level of Caesar II. You must "
"see to it that your Capital City is wealthy and safe, and that your "
"people lead rich, happy lives.\n"
"\n"
"On the Province Level, you will tend to issues that are on a different "
"scale than those of the City Level, but which will directly affect the "
"well-being of your Capital City. Any Industrial Sources (Mines, "
"Quarries, Farms, etc.) you build on the Province Level will feed your "
"Businesses and Markets on the City Level, and thus must be connected to "
"the city by road.\n"
"\n"
"#43Next Page#\n"
"#761Tips#"
msgstr ""

