#. help page 775: title
msgctxt "help/775/0"
msgid "Help with Barbarian Tribes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/775/1"
msgid ""
"Tribes of various sizes may live within your Provincial borders. These "
"are communities of people who have not yet acknowledged the authority "
"of the Roman Empire, and may even be hostile toward you as its "
"representative. To subdue a Tribe, you may send a Cohort into its den. "
"If your Cohort defeats the tribe in battle, it will come under your "
"control as a Roman Town.\n"
"\n"
"If you leave a hostile Tribe alone too long, it may grow in size and "
"power, and may eventually send out an \"Uprising\" of troops to sack your "
"city and destroy it brick by brick."
msgstr ""

