#. help page 790: title
msgctxt "help/790/0"
msgid "Help with Towns"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/790/1"
msgid ""
"Roman Towns are communities that are friendly toward the Roman Empire, "
"and welcome its authority. At the beginning of a game, however, these "
"Towns will be rather small and isolated from your Capital City.\n"
"\n"
"By building road connections between your Capital City and and any "
"outlying Towns, you will improve your business trade, and you will "
"likely see the Towns grow in size.\n"
"\n"
"#791Tips#"
msgstr ""

#. help page 791: title
msgctxt "help/791/0"
msgid "Tips for Towns"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/791/1"
msgid ""
"Connecting outlying towns to your city via provincial roads will help "
"the towns to grow and will improve the economy of your capital city. \n"
"\n"
