#. help page 820: title
msgctxt "help/820/0"
msgid "Help with Sealanes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/820/1"
msgid ""
"Sealanes are the oversea trade routes by which you may bring foreign "
"goods into your Province. To see which goods are available in each "
"seaward direction, consult the Merchant in your Forum. Each item listed "
"with a ship icon and a sealane name is an item that is available from "
"that side of your Province.\n"
"\n"
"To receive an item from a sealane, you must build a Port on its seaward "
"side of your Province. A Shipyard will provide more ships, which will "
"incease the volume of trade to its adjacent Port."
