#. help page 895: title
msgctxt "help/895/0"
msgid "Work Camps"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/895/1"
msgid ""
"Work Camps must be adjacent to their industries. Work Camps provide "
"housing for the laborers who keep the source running. You will be "
"prompted to build a Work Camp, if it is needed,  whenever you build an "
"industrial source (i.e. Farm, Mine, Quarry, etc.) on the Province Level.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""

#. help page 896: title
msgctxt "help/896/0"
msgid "Industries and Industrial Support"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/896/1"
msgid ""
"When selecting a site for an industry, make sure that it has plenty of "
"empty space next to it so that you can give it road access, a work camp "
"and one or more warehouses.  Some sites will have more accessibility "
"than others.\n"
"\n"
"Don't build more workcamps than you can easily fill with plebs; if you "
"do, all of your industries will suffer for it.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
