#. help page 940: title
msgctxt "help/940/0"
msgid "Help with Farms"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/940/1"
msgid ""
"Farms can be placed on patches of Meadow, which are represented on the "
"map by flat, brown and green areas. You will not be able to place a "
"farm on anything other than Meadow land. When you place a farm, you "
"will be given a choice of what type of agriculture it should focus on "
"(i.e. wheat, grapes, cattle, etc.). The types of agriculture available "
"will vary from province to province. Farms must be connected to your "
"city by roads, and must be accompanied by both a Warehouse and a Work "
"Camp.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""

#. help page 941: title
msgctxt "help/941/0"
msgid "Industries and Industrial Support"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/941/1"
msgid ""
"When selecting a site for an industry, make sure that it has plenty of "
"empty space next to it so that you can give it road access, a work camp "
"and one or more warehouses.  Some sites will have more accessibility "
"than others.\n"
"\n"
"Don't build more workcamps than you can easily fill with plebs; if you "
"do, all of your industries will suffer for it.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
