msgid "Game Speed"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/1021/1"
msgid ""
"This option controls how quickly time passes in the game.  It can be "
"set to any setting between 0 (stop) and 10 (very fast)."
msgstr ""

#. help page 1022: title
msgctxt "help/1022/0"
msgid "Scroll Speed"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "help/1022/1"
msgid ""
"This option controls how quickly the map-view scrolls when you move the "
"mouse to the edges of the screen.  It can be set to any setting between "
"0 (stop) and 10 (very fast)."
